{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>And to rule over the day and over the night.</b> To renew the coming-to-be of things in the lower realm. Then, along with the single light, there was need for the existence of living beings, which are more noble than plants." "<b>To distinguish between the light and between the darkness.</b> To distinguish, in the lower realm, through their shining and their setting, between the time of light, which He called Day, and the time of darkness, which He called Night, as He said above: <b>to distinguish between the Day and between the Night</b>."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:11:59.767612607Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}